  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n√{x} ÷ √{169} = 0.05\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\n√{a} ÷ √{b} = √{\\frac{a}{b}}\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n√x ÷ √{169} = 0.05\n\n⇒ √frac {x}{169}} = 0.05\n\n⇒ frac{√{x}}{13} = 0.05\n\n⇒ √x = 0.05 × 13\n\n⇒ √x = 0.65\n\n⇒ x = 0.65²\n\n⇒ x = 0.4225\n\n**The value of x is 0.4225.**",
